# Desolace & Shen'dralas (43-43): the Horde quests of Desolace and of Shen'dralas, the WoW Forever
# zone south of the Valley of Bones, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/desolace_shendralas_43_43.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Desolace, area 405;
# Shen'dralas, area 16651). The quest list is section 3 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
#
# The centaur clans: the Gelkis and the Magram are enemies, every quest for one costs reputation
# with the other, and Buying Friendship: Gelkis (94873) and Buying Friendship: Magram (94872) are
# exclusive. This guide sides with the Gelkis: Carved Centaur Totems, Buying Friendship: Gelkis,
# then Gelkis Alliance (1368) and Stealing Supplies (1370), the level 33-35 quests that open
# Leather Technique (92817).
# Left out:
# - Ongeku (1373): its Draenethyst Shard drops from Ongeku in the Swamp of Sorrows, which this
#   guide never visits. The Gelkis quests of the Valley of Bones follow it (Outing Outcasts 93037,
#   Saving Our Own 93058, Bone Burying 93062, Checking Things Out 93122, Going Home 93125, Khan Jehn
#   93128) and Khan Hratha for Uthek (1380, after Khan Jehn 1374, after Ongeku).
# - The Magram chain: A Conqueror's Crown (92743) needs a crown from a crypt in the Badlands; Valley
#   of Bones (92841), Outcast Necromancers (92846), Mountain of Bones (92844), Corrupting Tears
#   (92847), Proof of Concept (92873), Bone Raising (92894), No Mercy for the Weak (92893), Bristleback
#   Retreat (93066), Long-Term Solutions (93072), Threat of Starvation (93129), Return to Orgrul
#   (93188) and Khan Jehn (93196) follow it. Khan Hratha for Warug (1381) and Buying Friendship:
#   Magram (94872) are the Magram side of the clan choice.
# - On the Lam (79235), Cherry for Your Thoughts? (79236), No Honor Among Thieves (79242): handed in
#   in Booty Bay and in the Arathi Highlands.
# - Abridged Notes on Draenethyst (93678): handed in to Magtoor in the Swamp of Sorrows.
# - Passing the Blame (93601) and Not on Squealing Terms (93606): they follow Rot and Regret
#   (Maraudon) and Agamaggan's Blood (Razorfen Downs), dungeon quests.
# The Corrupter (1488) is only offered to those who did Maurin Bonesplitter's earlier Corrupter
# quests (1480-1484, level 33-35, the first started by a rare drop): its steps are for them.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house) and a flight to Shadowprey Village; Ghost Walker Post;
# the north (Kormek's Hut, the Kolkar, Thunder Axe Fortress, Azore's tower); the Valley of Spears;
# the Gelkis Village; Mannoroc Coven, the Magram Village and Gimashi's tower; the Valley of Bones
# into Shen'dralas and its pylons; back across Desolace for the pylon pieces and the hand-ins;
# Shen'dralas again: the temple, its gardens and the wilds.

guide Desolace & Shen'dralas (43-43)
faction horde
levels 43 43
carry 1117 1137 1183 1261 2864 2872 93464
leave 1117 1137 1183 1261 2864 2872 94895
next Tanaris (43-43)

# Orgrimmar: the auction house ------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
goto "Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and go into the city" at 50.0,60.0 r 60
note "Buy a Barbaric Harness at the auction house, for Talra of the Gelkis later (leatherworkers can make one)" npc 8673
tip It is cheap and rarely farmed; a Gelkis leatherworker asks for it in Desolace.
fly "Shadowprey Village, Desolace" npc 3310
tip No flight path to Shadowprey yet? Fly to Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains and ride south-west into Desolace.

# Shadowprey Village ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Desolace
fpath 6726
bind 11106
accept 5381
tip Taiga gives you the Demon Pick; use it on the red crystal in Thunder Axe Fortress.
accept 94895
tip The crate lies by the water south of the village. Its owner is in the Riverglades, for a later guide.

# Ghost Walker Post ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 96222
tip Umarak, a Kolkar, stands east of the Gelkis Village.
accept 93225 1368
accept 1488
tip Takata offers it only if you did Maurin Bonesplitter's earlier Corrupter quests; skip its steps otherwise.
accept 6134
accept 79229
tip The burnt-out campsite is west of Ghost Walker Post.

# The north: Kormek's Hut, the Kolkar, Thunder Axe Fortress, Azore -----------------------------------

turnin 79229
accept 5501
do 93225 bg at 71.5,45.5 mobs 4632 4633 4634 4635 4636 4637 "Kill Kolkar centaurs for Carved Centaur Totems"
tip Leave the Gelkis alone: killing them costs the reputation you need.
do 5381
tip Use the Demon Pick on the red crystal deep in the fortress; the Demon Spirit comes out and drops the box.
turnin 93464
accept 93465

# The Valley of Spears --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 96222 at 29.6,52.0 "Get a War Horn Mouthpiece from the Maraudine centaurs, sound it on the highest peak and kill Khan Hratha"
tip The mouthpiece is a rare drop. Khan Hratha is elite; one summon is enough for both of you.
do 93225 at 31.0,57.0 mobs 4654 4655 4656 4657 4658 4659 "Kill Maraudine centaurs until you have 5 Carved Centaur Totems"
accept 6132
do 6132 at 34.0,53.5 "Escort Melizza Brimbuzzle out of the Valley of Spears"
tip Melizza runs east out of the valley; keep the centaurs off her.
turnin 6132
do 5501
tip The bones lie among the kodo skeletons of the graveyard.
turnin 93225
accept 94873

