do 5581
tip Kill a Demon Portal Guardian, then use the Hand of Iruxos at its portal.
do 1488
tip Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod stand in the middle of the coven.
do 1370.1
tip The sacks of meat lie by the Magram tents.
do 93465
tip Gimashi is on top of her tower in the ravine south-east of the Magram Village.

# The Valley of Bones ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 6134
tip Set a Ghost Magnet down between the two Dead Goliaths, step back and kill the spectres it draws.
